      "message": "Follow the pattern used for the other I2C buses and devices:\n\n 1. Leave `i2c-port \u003d \u003c\u0026i2c_port_ish\u003e;` here.\n 2. In the project overlays map `i2c_port_ish` to the appropriate SOC-specific I2C bus name. Example: `i2c_port_ish: \u0026i2c5_0 {};`\n \nSteps 1 and 2 have already been done for ITE, NPCX\n\n 3. Define the ISH dsp-service node, I2C bus label, I2C freq in `\u0026i2c_port_ish {...}` in `rvp_i2c.dtsi`\n 4. Project overlays supply the ISH int-gpios: `\u0026dsp_service { int-gpios \u003d \u003c...\u003e };` (see the PDC nodes as an example)",
